    The cache key for `getDateTimeInstance(FULL, LONG, someTimeZone, null)` will be `Pair(Pair(Integer(FULL), Integer(LONG)), someTimeZone)`.
    And for `getDateTimeInstance(FULL, LONG, someTimeZone, someLocale)` will be `Pair(Pair(Pair(Integer(FULL), Integer(LONG)), someTimeZone), someLocale)`.
